  "description": "<span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>This application is intended to provide voters in Hays County, Texas, with easy access to basic elections information when there is no imminent election. Users can view their voting precinct.<\/span><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><br /><\/div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>This app is only intended to provide convenient access to current data related to Hays County elections. If you believe this information is inaccurate or you would like more information, please contact the Hays County Elections Department at (512) 393-7310 or elections@co.hays.tx.us.<\/div>",
